Please don't hurt me.

519
00:27:17,140 --> 00:27:17,970
Whoa!

520
00:27:18,053 --> 00:27:19,060
That's one big lady!

521
00:27:19,280 --> 00:27:20,840
I mean, big fish lady.

522
00:27:21,140 --> 00:27:22,637
Have you come to kill me, too?

523
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:23,777
Because I will have you now.

524
00:27:23,860 --> 00:27:24,742
I'm not afraid.

525
00:27:25,020 --> 00:27:26,140
No, not of you.

526
00:27:26,380 --> 00:27:27,817
Not of anyone else, either.

527
00:27:27,900 --> 00:27:30,200
I am the daughter of King Neptune.

528
00:27:30,580 --> 00:27:33,140
I'm not, I'm not afraid of anything.

529
00:27:33,560 --> 00:27:34,740
Nothing at all.

530
00:27:37,040 --> 00:27:38,800
Someone help me!

531
00:27:39,260 --> 00:27:40,157
Mother, please!

532
00:27:40,240 --> 00:27:41,340
Mother, please!

533
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:43,030
Hey, wait!

534
00:27:43,340 --> 00:27:45,575
We didn't come here to kill you, okay?

535
00:27:48,720 --> 00:27:50,260
You suck, lady!

536
00:27:50,700 --> 00:27:51,980
Shut up already!
